{{!--
  Template: welcome
  Data keys:
    - name           {string}  Recipient's first name
    - appUrl         {string}  Base URL of the app
    - ctaUrl         {string}  Onboarding CTA link
    - unsubscribeToken {string}
    - currentYear    {number}
--}}
<p class="email-greeting">Welcome aboard, {{name}}! 🎉</p>

<p>
  We're thrilled to have you join the BreathAway community. You've just taken
  the first step toward meaningful connections built on authenticity and
  intention.
</p>

<div class="email-highlight-box">
  <p>
    BreathAway is a space where you can breathe freely, show up as your true
    self, and connect with people who truly get you.
  </p>
</div>

<p>Here's what you can do right now to get started:</p>

<ul style="padding-left: 20px; color: #4B5563; line-height: 2;">
  <li>✅ Complete your profile so others can find you</li>
  <li>💫 Explore potential matches curated just for you</li>
  <li>💬 Start a conversation — the best ones begin with a single message</li>
</ul>

<div style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{ctaUrl}}" class="email-btn">Complete My Profile →</a>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #9CA3AF; margin-top: 24px;">
  If you didn't create a BreathAway account, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
